.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-clipboard 1 "" "Sway Things 0.3.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-clipboard \- Pick an entry of the clipboard history, or clear it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things clipboard\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pick an entry of the clipboard history, or clear it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sway\-things\-clipboard\-pick(1)
Show the history in the launcher that is installed (fuzzel, wofi, rofi, tofi or bemenu) and copy the entry you pick again; the history key runs this
.TP
sway\-things\-clipboard\-clear(1)
Remove every entry of the history
